# The third party test ROMs are fetched by get_test_roms.sh; they are somebody else's build output
# and do not belong in the repository.
roms/

# A real GBA BIOS image (the official IPL is copyrighted) is never part of the repository. Put your
# own copy here to run the tests that compare the emulator against the real BIOS, or point the
# emulator at it with `pureikyubu --gba --gba-bios <file>` / `gba_bench --run <rom> --bios <file>`.
bios/
